From f5ffe530edda111e58f7e5e089e6a2c19e7e0d67 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TeamHarrisCali <34009957+TeamHarrisCali@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 12:17:56 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Windows 95 touch keyboard; shorter Start menu, Shut down asks
 (w99t)

Keyboard art generated by scripts/make-keyboard-art.py (raised/sunken grey keys,
black legends, Caps light; same key positions); tile maps moved to VRAM C blocks
30/31 for the 314 tiles; strip/arrow tiles after the keyboard's; teal trackpad;
Bench quick button -> Mem. Start menu: puzzles in Games, Exit desktop in System,
5 px gap above the taskbar, Shut down confirmation box.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../drivers/input/touchscreen/keyboard.map.c  |  309 +----
 .../drivers/input/touchscreen/keyboard.raw.c  | 1145 +++++++++++------
 .../drivers/input/touchscreen/master.pal.c    |    7 +-
 .../drivers/input/touchscreen/nds_ts.c        |   27 +-
 user/microwin/src/demos/nanox/dsdesk.c        |   87 +-
 5 files changed, 859 insertions(+), 716 deletions(-)

